@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+.. change::
+    :tags: bug
+    :tickets: 8783
+
+    Adjusted internal use of the Python ``IntFlag`` class which changed its
+    behavioral contract in Python 3.11. This was not causing runtime failures
+    however caused typing runs to fail under Python 3.11.
